WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.412
The Sponsorship Scandal.

00:00:02.362 --> 00:00:11.462
100 million dollars in fraudulent contracts funnelled to Liberal-friendly advertising agencies after the 1995 Quebec referendum.

00:00:11.462 --> 00:00:16.750
Justice Gomery found the program was designed to funnel money to Liberal supporters.

00:00:16.750 --> 00:00:20.000
The RCMP laid criminal charges.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:22.225
Several were convicted.

00:00:22.225 --> 00:00:26.250
But the structural corruption that enabled it was never reformed.
